WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Welcome to our training Ship and Fulfill using third-party apps.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.517
Amazon sellers use a variety

00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:09.860
of technologies to launch, manage, and grow their businesses.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.373
Some stick to the tools available

00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:13.260
in Seller Central.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.311
They list using Add Products, ship using manage orders, and send inventory

00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:22.100
to fulfillment centers using the Send to Amazon workflow.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:25.553
Other sellers use third-party apps to

00:00:25.553 --> 00:00:29.660
list, ship, fulfill, and perform a variety of other business operations.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.080
You've probably used

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:37.200
apps before on a smartphone or tablet to complete a specific task, like rating a restaurant or

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.280
checking the weather.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.242
Amazon sellers can also use the specialized functionality of apps to

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.280
streamline and scale their businesses.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.888
We maintain a catalog of Amazon-approved apps in Seller Central

00:00:49.888 --> 00:00:51.900
in the Selling Partner App Store.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:58.542
You can visit the App Store anytime using the URL sellercentral.

00:00:58.542 --> 00:00:59.090
amazon.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:01.280
com/selling-partner-appstore.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.480
On the home page, select an app category to browse or use the search bar to locate a specific app

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:08.840
by

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.200
name.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:15.680
Click an app's icon to go to its detail page where you can review features and functionality.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:22.200
We provide contact information and web links so you can quickly access and use apps.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:27.440
Each app in the Selling Partner App Store is reviewed and authorized by Amazon.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.080
The developers who publish in the App Store are vetted by Amazon too.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.909
Some of the apps we list

00:01:34.909 --> 00:01:36.600
integrate directly with Seller Central.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.067
Others are standalone, but all the apps in the App Store

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:45.000
have access to the same kind of selling data you see in Seller Central.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.365
Their access is secured

00:01:47.365 --> 00:01:50.489
through one of our two API services.

00:01:50.489 --> 00:01:54.815
Selling Partner API or SP API or our Legacy Service,

00:01:54.815 --> 00:01:58.480
Marketplace Web Service, also called Amazon MWS.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:01.720
Now that you know a little more about third-party

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:08.229
apps and where to find them, let's focus on apps that can help with FBA or fulfillment by Amazon

00:02:08.229 --> 00:02:08.600
shipments.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:13.880
We'll also review apps that can help with MFN or merchant-fulfilled orders.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:19.560
Using an app to ship inventory or fulfill orders can offer several advantages.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.827
An app with specific

00:02:21.827 --> 00:02:27.800
features might help you create FBA shipments faster, or it could make it easier to purchase

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.000
shipping for MFN orders.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:33.474
An app might also make printing labels, tracking shipments,

00:02:33.474 --> 00:02:35.560
and packing items more intuitive.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:39.930
To illustrate the range of shipping and fulfillment apps available

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:47.560
in the Selling Partner App Store, let's review three examples, ShipStation, ScanPower, and Shippo.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:52.680
Note that these examples don't constitute recommendations from Amazon.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.303
They're offered

00:02:53.303 --> 00:02:58.600
here as information to help you explore all the third-party apps available in the App Store.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:05.320
ShipStation provides sellers with features that support both MFN and FBA fulfillment.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:13.387
You can use ShipStation to import MFN orders in bulk so you no longer have to copy and paste

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:15.320
information manually from Seller Central.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.380
Or you can use ShipStation to compare carrier rates,

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.560
print shipping labels, and manage your buy shipping services from Amazon.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:29.720
The app updates tracking information in real time too and makes it available to customers.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:36.545
You can also use ShipStation to create FBA shipping labels and receive notifications on the status

00:03:36.545 --> 00:03:37.720
of FBA shipments.

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:44.040
ScanPower helps simplify FBA shipments using a feature called Boxt.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:50.440
You can use ScanPower to provide box content information for multiple shipments simultaneously.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:56.520
It also allows you to scan and pack items while printing 2D barcodes for box content.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.680
And it can warn you about incorrect items or quantities.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:07.897
You can also use ScanPower to get packing history reports which can help track and enhance FBA

00:04:07.897 --> 00:04:08.680
related operations.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:14.680
Finally, Shippo helps sellers streamline and reduce costs for MFN orders.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:20.040
You can use Shippo to find and compare discounted shipping rates across carriers.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:25.480
You can use it to create business rules that print your shipping labels faster.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:29.960
Shippo can also help you validate shipping addresses and avoid failed deliveries.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:37.063
Additionally, Shippo can help you schedule pickups, customize shipping labels, and automate customer

00:04:37.063 --> 00:04:37.560
notifications.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:44.511
ShipStation, Boxt by ScanPower, and Shippo are just a small sample of the third-party

00:04:44.511 --> 00:04:48.840
apps available in the Selling Partner App Store to help you ship and fulfill.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:56.280
We encourage you to explore additional shipping and fulfillment apps for both FBA and MFN sellers

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:01.160
by clicking the Shipping Solutions category on the App Store home page.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.693
On the next page,

00:05:02.693 --> 00:05:08.840
use filters to find apps designed for specific programs or to search by star rating, language,

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:09.640
or store.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.991
We also encourage you to explore apps in other categories that might help streamline

00:05:14.991 --> 00:05:16.360
and scale your business.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:24.440
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store.
